7}ÕC¬ãß÷!êHdlzH5ñïÿ␀#’¢Ä]R:'␀␀␀␀IEND®B`‚{"name": "File Manager", "publisher": "MicroPythonOS", "short_description": "Manage files", "long_description": "Traverse around the filesystem and manage files and folders you find..", "fullname": "com.micropythonos.file_manager", "version": "0.3.3", "category": "utilities", "activities": [{"entrypoint": "file_manager_app.py", "classname": "FileExplorerActivity", "intent_filters": [{"action": "main", "category": "launcher"}]}]}"""
